---
title: "I thought my daemon was one process. It's actually five."
description: "A memory question turned into a native crash, a database lock, and a debugging script that hung itself. Five wrong assumptions about process lifecycle."
date: "2026-07-25"
draft: false
tags: ["smriti", "daemon", "process-management", "sqlite", "bun", "developer-tools", "debugging"]
